        "【証言】鈴仙「二打鐘の後、月光門を閉じた」てゐ「門が先に暗くなり、二打鐘が鳴った」\n【機器】鐘録音器は標準より18秒遅れ。門制御器は満月切替ごと00:00へ。廊下照度計は正常。\n【照度】21:14:42に80→12。録音の二打鐘は21:14:31。",
        "[Testimony] Reisen: “I closed the moonlight gate after the second bell.” Tewi: “The gate dimmed first, then the second bell sounded.”\n[Devices] Bell recorder clock is 18 seconds slow; gate controller resets to 00:00 after each full-moon switch; corridor light meter is correctly timed.\n[Illuminance] 80→12 at 21:14:42; recorder labels the second bell 21:14:31.",
